    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Prior major hypersensitivity to a cephalosporin. Cross-reactivity with penicillin is about 2%, negligible for third- or fourth-generation agents or dissimilar side chains; may be given cautiously after delayed penicillin hypersensitivity if necessary."
     }
